{"report_id":"dev_013","pdf_path":"data/local/generated/dev/dev_013/report.pdf","figures":[{"figure_id":"fig1","report_id":"dev_013","image_path":"data/local/work/dev/dev_013/p0_x7.png","caption":"Accuracy during training for the models in this experiment.","number":1,"chart_type":"line","page":0,"text_lines":["Accuracy during training","95","90","85","80",">","75","70","DistilBERT","—e","65","—— VGG-16","10","20","30","40","50","60","Epoch","DistiIBERT","VGG-16","10","20","30","40","50","60"],"y_span":33.53773584905661},{"figure_id":"fig2","report_id":"dev_013","image_path":"data/local/work/dev/dev_013/p0_x8.png","caption":"Training loss for the models in this experiment.","number":2,"chart_type":"line","page":0,"text_lines":["loss","Training","1.75","OenlBEAT","——","BERT-bece","1.50","— MoebifeNet","Ours","—","1.25","— ResNet-50","% 1,00","Ss","0.75","0.50","0.25","2","6","10","14","ig","22","Epoch","BERT-base","MobdeNet","Ours","2","6","10","14","18","22"],"y_span":1.8563429618452272}],"sentences":[{"sentence_id":"dev_013_s0","report_id":"dev_013","text":"Lab Report: Comparing CNN architectures","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_013_s1","report_id":"dev_013","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_013_s2","report_id":"dev_013","text":"All experiments were run on a single GPU with 24 GB of memory.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_013_s3","report_id":"dev_013","text":"The dataset was split into 70 percent training data and the rest for testing.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_013_s4","report_id":"dev_013","text":"Figure 1 shows the accuracy during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_013_s5","report_id":"dev_013","text":"DistilBERT outperforms VGG-16 by 5 percentage points at epoch 10.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_013_s6","report_id":"dev_013","text":"As shown in Figure 1, at epoch 30, DistilBERT is 12.9 points better than VGG-16.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_013_s7","report_id":"dev_013","text":"At epoch 10, DistilBERT achieves about 70% accuracy.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_013_s8","report_id":"dev_013","text":"VGG-16 reaches 78.8% accuracy at epoch 50 (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_013_s9","report_id":"dev_013","text":"Figure 2 shows the training loss.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_013_s10","report_id":"dev_013","text":"MobileNet has a loss of 0.377 at epoch 14.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_013_s11","report_id":"dev_013","text":"As shown in Figure 2, at epoch 22, the loss of DistilBERT is 1.036.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_013_s12","report_id":"dev_013","text":"At epoch 10, the loss of BERT-base is 0.602 (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_013_s13","report_id":"dev_013","text":"On SST-2, XGBoost obtains an accuracy of 73.6%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_013_s14","report_id":"dev_013","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"}]}